    ('Derveni_All_001', 'Derveni_All', '[Props]Alexia', 'Are you tired of fighting, my warrior? What do you need? I like eating olives.'),
    ('Derveni_All_002', 'Derveni_All', 'Sedge Merchant', 'Use sedge as the book carrier. Great scholars love recording history and spreading philosophy.'),
    ('Derveni_All_003', 'Derveni_All', 'Achaeans Soldier', 'Achaean people are the bravest soldiers in Greece. Our leader is Achilles.'),
    ('Derveni_All_004', 'Derveni_All', 'Tiryns Elder', 'Tiryns is a town of Peloponnesus and next to Mycenae.'),
    ('Derveni_All_005', 'Derveni_All', 'Eurystheus', 'My father Sthenleus drove Amphitryon out of Argo.'),
    ('Derveni_All_006', 'Derveni_All', 'Everes', 'Athena deprived my son of his sight as a punishment for peering at her while bathing. It was useless for Chariclo to beg Athena to take the curse away.'),
    ('Derveni_All_007', 'Derveni_All', 'Lynceus', 'We Electryon family and Tereus family are all later generations of Perseus, but our relationship is not good. Because Poseidon planted a piece of golden hair on Tereus, so Tereus became immortal, but his sons went back for their grandfather''s property, so we fought each other, and only one person was left in each family.'),
    ('Derveni_All_008', 'Derveni_All', 'Athenian Assassin', 'You can submit poisons to me in an attempt to assassinate the hostile Consul.'),
