    ('Guardwa2_001', 'Guardwa2', 'Cross-Server Duel Athenian Drillmaster', 'Cross-server Duels use a set of fairly simple rules. Every player from an opposing faction killed in a duel will earn you 1 point. 2 points are earned from killing 1 Stickman, spawned every 5 min in the middle of the Battlefield. A duel session lasts 30 minutes, with the better-scoring faction declared the winner. The first faction to score is the winner if there is a draw. Pretty straight forward huh? Just saddle up and charge into the fray!'),
    ('Guardwa2_002', 'Guardwa2', 'Cross-Server Duel Athenian Priest', 'My job is to help restore the strength of brave warriors!'),
    ('Guardwa2_003', 'Guardwa2', 'Cross-Server Duel Spartan Drillmaster', 'Cross-server Duels use a set of fairly simple rules. Every player from an opposing faction killed in a duel will earn you 1 point. 2 points are earned from killing 1 Stickman, spawned every 5 min in the middle of the Battlefield. A duel session lasts 30 minutes, with the better-scoring faction declared the winner. The first faction to score is the winner if there is a draw. Pretty straight forward huh? Just saddle up and charge into the fray!'),
    ('Guardwa2_004', 'Guardwa2', 'Cross-Server Duel Spartan Priest', 'My job is to help restore the strength of brave warriors!'),
    ('Guardwar_001', 'Guardwar', 'Athens Youth Corps Drillmaster', 'When our youth corps went on their military training in the Ni Mini Valley, they saw the Spartan youth corps training there too. Would you like to seize the opportunity to show them your strength?    |cffF14187 Go to the battlefront through the portal behind me, and deal them a deadly blow as soon as possible.|cffffffff'),
    ('Guardwar_002', 'Guardwar', 'Athens Youth Corps Clergy', 'I am able to help you restore your power faster.'),
    ('Guardwar_003', 'Guardwar', 'Sparta Youth Corps Drillmaster', 'When our youth corps went on their military training in the Ni Mini Valley, they saw the Athens youth corps training there too. Would you like to seize the opportunity to show them your strength?    |cffF14187 Go to the battlefront through the portal behind me, and deal them a deadly blow as soon as possible.|cffffffff'),
