    ('Isthmus_All_001', 'Isthmus_All', 'Polybus', 'I am the king of Corinth. Arduous labor is needed to open up the wasteland.'),
    ('Isthmus_All_002', 'Isthmus_All', 'Merope', 'My child was eaten by beasts. Take care!'),
    ('Isthmus_All_003', 'Isthmus_All', 'King''s Shepherd', 'I once picked up a baby, his name was Oedipus. The king and queen soon adopted him.'),
