    ('Labyrinth_001', 'Labyrinth', 'Zeus'' Envoy 1', 'Zeus bade me sneak in and help the Warriors, who possed a |cff39D8B8Zeus'' Oracle|cffffffff.'),
    ('Labyrinth_002', 'Labyrinth', 'Zeus'' Envoy 2', 'Zeus bade me sneak in and help the Warriors, who possed a |cff39D8B8Zeus'' Oracle|cffffffff.'),
    ('Labyrinth_003', 'Labyrinth', 'Zeus'' Envoy 3', 'Zeus bade me sneak in and help the Warriors, who possed a |cff39D8B8Zeus'' Oracle|cffffffff.'),
    ('Labyrinth_004', 'Labyrinth', 'Zeus'' Envoy 4', 'Zeus bade me sneak in and help the Warriors, who possed a |cff39D8B8Zeus'' Oracle|cffffffff.'),
    ('Labyrinth_005', 'Labyrinth', 'Zeus'' Envoy 5', 'Zeus bade me sneak in and help the Warriors, who possed a |cff39D8B8Zeus'' Oracle|cffffffff.'),
    ('Labyrinth_006', 'Labyrinth', 'Zeus'' Envoy', 'Zeus bade me sneak in and give you a |cff39D8B8Zeus'' Oracle|cffffffff.'),
    ('Larissa_All_001', 'Larissa_All', 'Phorbas', 'I come from Delphi. Have you ever been to the Temple of Apollo there?'),
    ('Larissa_All_002', 'Larissa_All', 'Amphissus', 'I am a white poplar. My annual rings record human history.'),
    ('Larissa_All_003', 'Larissa_All', 'Oeneus', 'My polis Calydon often holds a Boar Hunt. I will invite all Greek warriors to join in it. I came here for Dionysus grapevine.'),
    ('Larissa_All_004', 'Larissa_All', 'Thestios', 'Aetolia is the opposite polis of Athens and Sparta in Greece.'),
    ('Larissa_All_005', 'Larissa_All', 'Bellerophon', 'I will ride my horse flying to Olympus...Even Zeus cannot stop me!'),
    ('Larissa_All_006', 'Larissa_All', 'Mysterious Priest', 'Bellerophon adopted this name after he killed his brother by mistake.'),
    ('Larissa_All_007', 'Larissa_All', 'Laodamia', 'My father rode Pegasus and defeated the Chimera in Lycia.'),
    ('Larissa_All_008', 'Larissa_All', 'Isandros', 'Lycia lies on the Anatolia Plateau. Solymi and the Amazons live nearby. I will go on an expedition there with my father.'),
    ('Larissa_All_009', 'Larissa_All', 'Hippolochus', 'Although my father is brave, he hates war. I plan to help the Trojans fight the Greeks.'),
    ('Larissa_All_010', 'Larissa_All', 'Meleager', 'Atalanta is wild but beautiful. Her accurate archery is as good as any male warrior.'),
    ('Larissa_All_011', 'Larissa_All', '[Props]Althaea', 'My father Meleager is famous as a warrior from Calydon to Aetolia.'),
    ('Larissa_All_012', 'Larissa_All', 'Ancaeus', 'Go on an expedition! An expedition! When will we get to our hometown Acadia?'),
    ('Larissa_All_013', 'Larissa_All', 'Agapenor', 'Ancaeus is my father. I will take part in the Calydon Boar Hunt this year.'),
    ('Larissa_All_014', 'Larissa_All', 'Telamon', 'Have you seen Ajax.E and Ajax? The name "Ajax" was coined by my friend Hercules.'),
    ('Larissa_All_015', 'Larissa_All', 'Thoas.A', 'I want to join Aetolia.'),
    ('Larissa_All_016', 'Larissa_All', 'Acastus', 'After Jason left, I became the king of Iolcus.'),
    ('Larissa_All_017', 'Larissa_All', 'Tired Visitor', 'I really need a break to eat some delicious turkey.'),
    ('Larissa_All_018', 'Larissa_All', 'Medeus', 'Jason left me in the care of Chiron. I grow in the mountain and know how to protect myself.'),
    ('Larissa_All_019', 'Larissa_All', '[Warrior]Snow Fox', 'Hah, I am called the fox... Where is my servant?'),
    ('Larissa_All_020', 'Larissa_All', '[Scholar]White Pigeon', 'Pigeons are flying lightly...On such a snowy day, do you want to see some dazzling magic?'),
    ('Larissa_All_021', 'Larissa_All', '[Skill]Centuried Bear', 'At the foot of the mountain, an old bear becomes a genius...Have you ever heard the fable of the bear princess? A brown bear negotiated with a hunter. The hunter said,"I only want your fur coat." The bear said, "I just want something to eat." So the bear ate the hunter, satisfying its hunger, and the hunter also got the fur coat he desired.'),
    ('Larissa_All_022', 'Larissa_All', '[Jewelry]Anthea', 'I like making flower decorations.'),
    ('Larissa_All_023', 'Larissa_All', '[Warehouse] Origin', 'We have a wide business region. If there are any problems please visit our website. Thank you.'),
    ('Lelantine_Farm_001', 'Lelantine_Farm', 'Sorehead Ninto', 'Damn, those wild dogs are so annoying. They''ve completely destroyed my vineyard. I will never forgive them. Greek warriors, I will give you some tuck nets. Please capture all of them.'),
    ('Lelantine_Farm_002', 'Lelantine_Farm', 'Delighted Kelsis', 'Wow, what cute doggies! I love them so much. I really don''t understand why Ninto hates them. Isn''t is nice to see them running around? By the way, traveler, can you tame some doggies for me? I''ve got some nice rewards prepared.'),
    ('Lelantine_Farm_003', 'Lelantine_Farm', 'Athenian Advance Troop Captain', 'The evil stalkers have wreaked havoc in Lelantine recently. They''ve been attacking creatures and demolishing crops. The Euboea High Priest hopes we''ll send troops to eliminate them. Brave Athenians have never declined a friendly request from allies especially when we need to offer large quantities of quality Euboea grape wine to the Hieron. It''s said the Spartans are ready to do something too, but I don''t believe they will be able to eliminate the stalkers. The truth will come out and everyone will know that the Athenias are the most powerful city-state in Greece.'),
    ('Lelantine_Farm_004', 'Lelantine_Farm', 'Athenian Quartermaster', 'Lelantine used to be so beautiful! Those hateful stalkers have destroyed it. I am offering tons of tuck nets to whoever can capture them – all of them!'),
    ('Lelantine_Farm_005', 'Lelantine_Farm', 'Returning Helper', 'The advance force has kept in close contact with the main city. We can send you there instantly.'),
    ('Lelantine_Farm_006', 'Lelantine_Farm', 'Spartan Advance Troop Captain', 'The evil stalkers have wreaked havoc in Lelantine recently. They''ve been attacking creatures and demolishing crops. The Euboea High Priest hopes we''ll send troops to eliminate them and we are looking to pick up large quantities of high quality Euboea grape wine for the sacrifice. It''s said the Euboea High Priest also asked the boy toy Athenians for help. Ha-ha, have you ever heard something so funny!? How can the pathetic Athenians beat those stalkers? Us Spartans are going to put them down and show the Athenians how real warriors get things done!'),
    ('Lelantine_Farm_007', 'Lelantine_Farm', 'Spartan Quartermaster', 'Lelantine used to be so beautiful! Those hateful stalkers have destroyed it. I am offering tons of tuck nets to whoever can capture them – all of them!'),
    ('Lelantine_Farm_008', 'Lelantine_Farm', 'Returning Helper', 'The advance force has kept in close contact with the main city. We can send you there instantly.'),
    ('Love_Island_001', 'Love_Island', 'Mine Vein', 'There is a mysterious mine that''s said to contain tons of copper ore, silver ore and more stretching off toward the sunken kingdom of Atlantis in the deep sea. Gathering tools, such as a Hoe, are required to dig for ore.'),
    ('Love_Island_002', 'Love_Island', 'Mine Vein', 'There is a mysterious mine that''s said to contain tons of copper ore, silver ore and more stretching off toward the sunken kingdom of Atlantis in the deep sea. Gathering tools, such as a Hoe, are required to dig for ore.'),
    ('Love_Island_003', 'Love_Island', 'Mine Vein', 'There is a mysterious mine that''s said to contain tons of copper ore, silver ore and more stretching off toward the sunken kingdom of Atlantis in the deep sea. Gathering tools, such as a Hoe, are required to dig for ore.'),
    ('Love_Island_004', 'Love_Island', 'Hunting Range', 'Medusa Island is inhabited by many different creatures. The environment there is pristine and can yield significant amounts of materials like hides and fur. Gathering tools, such as Arrows, are required to collect them.'),
    ('Love_Island_005', 'Love_Island', 'Hunting Range', 'Medusa Island is inhabited by many different creatures. The environment there is pristine and can yield significant amounts of materials like hides and fur. Gathering tools, such as Arrows, are required to collect them.'),
    ('Love_Island_006', 'Love_Island', 'Hunting Range', 'Medusa Island is inhabited by many different creatures. The environment there is pristine and can yield significant amounts of materials like hides and fur. Gathering tools, such as Arrows, are required to collect them.'),
    ('Love_Island_007', 'Love_Island', 'Nifty Garden', 'A lush garden overgrown with all kinds of outlandish plants. A variety of Herbs can be collected with the aid of gathering tools such as a Hoe.'),
    ('Love_Island_008', 'Love_Island', 'Nifty Garden', 'A lush garden overgrown with all kinds of outlandish plants. A variety of Herbs can be collected with the aid of gathering tools such as a Hoe.'),
    ('Love_Island_009', 'Love_Island', 'Nifty Garden', 'A lush garden overgrown with all kinds of outlandish plants. A variety of Herbs can be collected with the aid of gathering tools such as a Hoe.'),
    ('Love_Island_010', 'Love_Island', 'Gathering Node Transporter', 'I can transport you back to any of the gathering nodes - Mine Vein, Forestry Center and Hunting Range.'),
    ('Love_Island_011', 'Love_Island', 'Main City Transporter', 'I can transport you back to the main city.'),
    ('Love_Island_012', 'Love_Island', 'Mine Vein', 'There is a mysterious mine that''s said to contain tons of copper ore, silver ore and more stretching off toward the sunken kingdom of Atlantis in the deep sea. Gathering tools, such as a Hoe, are required to dig for ore.'),
    ('Love_Island_013', 'Love_Island', 'Mine Vein', 'There is a mysterious mine that''s said to contain tons of copper ore, silver ore and more stretching off toward the sunken kingdom of Atlantis in the deep sea. Gathering tools, such as a Hoe, are required to dig for ore.'),
    ('Love_Island_014', 'Love_Island', 'Hunting Range', 'Medusa Island is inhabited by many different creatures. The environment there is pristine and can yield significant amounts of materials like hides and fur. Gathering tools, such as Arrows, are required to collect them.'),
    ('Love_Island_015', 'Love_Island', 'Hunting Range', 'Medusa Island is inhabited by many different creatures. The environment there is pristine and can yield significant amounts of materials like hides and fur. Gathering tools, such as Arrows, are required to collect them.'),
    ('Love_Island_016', 'Love_Island', 'Nifty Garden', 'A lush garden overgrown with all kinds of outlandish plants. A variety of Herbs can be collected with the aid of gathering tools such as a Hoe.'),
    ('Love_Island_017', 'Love_Island', 'Nifty Garden', 'A lush garden overgrown with all kinds of outlandish plants. A variety of Herbs can be collected with the aid of gathering tools such as a Hoe.'),
    ('Marathon_All_001', 'Marathon_All', 'Spyridon', 'You are coming. A good day, isn''t it? But I feel something is missing…'),
    ('Marathon_All_002', 'Marathon_All', 'Penelope', 'My little sister Circe snuck away to play, and now I can''t find her…'),
    ('Marathon_All_003', 'Marathon_All', 'Dionigi', 'You can visit the splendid temple in the main city. Every year there are lots of people involved in the sacrificial ceremony. It is said that Athena will befall near us.'),
    ('Marathon_All_004', 'Marathon_All', 'Circe', 'Little sheep…'),
    ('Marathon_All_005', 'Marathon_All', 'Gerrhus', 'I will guard here.'),
    ('Marathon_All_006', 'Marathon_All', 'Crophi', 'I am patrolling, what are you doing?'),
    ('Marathon_All_007', 'Marathon_All', 'Barca', 'I like charging in the front.'),
    ('Marathon_All_008', 'Marathon_All', 'Iakovou', 'A lot of soldiers have been arriving recently, will there be a war?'),
    ('Marathon_All_009', 'Marathon_All', '[Props]Thoas', 'Hey, various medicines are available. Gods bless you!'),
    ('Marathon_All_010', 'Marathon_All', 'War Supplier 3', 'You should submit |cffF14187War Material 1 through War Material 4 in sequence|cffffffff together with your guild members. After that, you will obtain rewards. In addition, your guild will obtain extra rewards. You can also hand in the materials to |cffF14187War Supplier 1|cffffffff in the main city or |cffF14187War Supplier 2|cffffffff in the suburbs of Athens.'),
    ('Marathon_All_011', 'Marathon_All', 'Ancient Relics 2', 'Exchange |cff39D8B8Sheepskin Scroll 2|cffffffff for |cff39D8B8Lost Book Chapter 2|cffffffff.'),
    ('Marathon_All_012', 'Marathon_All', 'Ancient Relics 5', 'Exchange |cff39D8B8Sheepskin Scroll 5|cffffffff for |cff39D8B8Lost Book Chapter 5|cffffffff.'),
    ('Marathon_All_013', 'Marathon_All', '[Athenian Cadian] General Soterios', 'If you have more Cadian Plates, feel free to exchange them with me for experience points.'),
    ('Marathon_All_014', 'Marathon_All', 'Key Collector', 'I''ve collected some pieces of the key. You can claim them during the event time, and then use them to unlock the IGG Anniversary Chest.                                                           Location of the IGG Anniversary Envoy                          Sparta (158,69)                                                      Athens (158,69)'),
    ('MasterInvite', '', '', '|cffFFFF00I want an apprentice|cffffffff'),
    ('Medusa_Island_001', 'Medusa_Island', 'Perseus', 'You are welcome to help! Before dealing with Medusa, we must first clear out all the monsters along the way. There are monsters hiding on all 3 paths to the isolated island, with the level of difficulty varying from path to path. Please choose the most suitable path for yourself, and remember the more you kill, the better the rewards. When you reach the end of the path, you will see Medusa - then defeat her!'),
    ('Medusa_Island2_001', 'Medusa_Island2', 'Correction Officer', 'I can''t remember how long I''ve been here, nor can I remember the number of criminals this place housed over the years. You can leave this place early if you can pass my 3 tests, or else, you will serve your term here with me.'),
    ('Megara_All_001', 'Megara_All', 'Iphicrades', 'I must defend my country, why not come with me? Megara and Elosmith Town are Athens'' allies.'),
    ('Megara_All_002', 'Megara_All', 'Serafim', 'Oh, the oracle says: You are a good man.'),
    ('Megara_All_003', 'Megara_All', 'Eyfimias', 'It''s hasn''t been safe recently. I hope the war will be over soon. I hope the Gods are watching over us on Olympus.'),
    ('Megara_All_004', 'Megara_All', 'Sebastiane', 'What a fine day! Why not go hunting outdoors?'),
    ('Megara_All_005', 'Megara_All', 'Postman', 'It must be much faster to deliver letters with a carriage, but now the carriages are widely used in battles.'),
    ('Megara_All_006', 'Megara_All', '[Props]Philemon', 'Contentment brings happiness. Look at these oaks, they grow well with much rainwater.'),
    ('Megara_All_007', 'Megara_All', 'Byzas', 'I will guide people of Megara to the east and develop new territory. It is said that there is a wide land to the north of Lydia and to the east of Thrace. It''s also the place to which the Olympian gods are paying attention.'),
    ('Megara_All_008', 'Megara_All', 'Theognis', 'Greeks are good at writing poetry, such as dirges, battle songs and love songs.'),
    ('Megara_All_009', 'Megara_All', 'Elosmith Clergyman', 'Elosmith…mystery… Elosmith town often holds sacrificial ceremonies.'),
    ('Megara_All_010', 'Megara_All', 'Fisherman', 'What kind of things haven''t I seen?'),
    ('Megara_All_011', 'Megara_All', 'Chruses', 'Apollo sent the plague. Agamemnon and his attendants will pay for it.'),
    ('Megara_All_012', 'Megara_All', 'Pylades', 'I am Orestes''s servant. Did you see him? He is great, I will follow him forever.'),
    ('Megara_All_013', 'Megara_All', 'Ancient Relics 7', 'Exchange |cff39D8B8Sheepskin Scroll 7|cffffffff for |cff39D8B8Lost Book Chapter 7|cffffffff.'),
    ('Megara_All_014', 'Megara_All', 'Athenian Physician', 'I am the best physician in Greece. What can I do for you?'),
    ('Megara_All_015', 'Megara_All', 'Athenian Apothecary', 'From 7:00pm through 9:00pm on Fridays, you can claim some deadly poisons from me and then turn it over to an Assassin with the mission of taking down the hostile Consul. You can even choose to do it yourself, which is more rewarding but more risky.     Assassin''s Location:                                              Argolis (-160，132)    Argolis (78，83)   Derveni (-149，33)        Consul''s Location:                                                Argolis (-17，105)'),
    ('Megara_All_016', 'Megara_All', 'Athenian Consul', 'Hey brave warrior, I am the Athenian Consul. What have you got to contribute?'),
    ('Megara_All_017', 'Megara_All', 'Spartan Assassin', 'You can submit poisons to me in an attempt to assassinate the hostile Consul.'),
    ('Megara_All_018', 'Megara_All', 'Spartan Assassin', 'You can submit poisons to me in an attempt to assassinate the hostile Consul.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_001', 'Mycenae_All', 'Nestor', 'I am Nestor. Neleus is my father.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_002', 'Mycenae_All', 'Thrasymedes', 'My father is Nestor. I am in command of a large contingent of troops.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_003', 'Mycenae_All', 'Podaleirios', 'Machaon is my brother. Hopefully I can become a great surgeon like him one day.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_004', 'Mycenae_All', 'Telesphoros', 'I should wear a hood and a cloak so I look like a traveling surgeon.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_005', 'Mycenae_All', 'Hygea', 'Have you ever been to Cyprus? It is an extraordinary isle located off the southeast coast in the Mediterranean sea.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_006', 'Mycenae_All', 'Asclepius', 'Chiron has taught me many healing methods. Collecting the correct herbs to apply to wounds is critical. The wound will heal quickly.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_007', 'Mycenae_All', 'Epione', 'The Hotsprings are very effective in pacifying souls and healing scars. So I believe building a statue beside the hotsprings will help calm people''s souls even more.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_008', 'Mycenae_All', 'Aceso', 'All talented surgeons walk with aid of intricate staves. They are very useful, and boy, do they look cool!'),
    ('Mycenae_All_009', 'Mycenae_All', 'Sarpedon', 'My parents were Zeus and Europa. I constantly travel all over Mycenae. Rhadamanthus is my brother. He is in Thebes right now.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_010', 'Mycenae_All', 'Physician', 'Want a massage? I rub you long time.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_011', 'Mycenae_All', '[Props]Meryl', 'Have you ever heard of Andromeda, the Ethiopian princess? People created a statue for her along the coast.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_012', 'Mycenae_All', '[Warehouse]Kurd', 'The churchwomen of Dionysus really enjoy hosting carnivals on Cithaero.'),
    ('Mycenae_All_013', 'Mycenae_All', 'Transporter', 'I''ve been waiting for you!'),
    ('Mycenae_All_014', 'Mycenae_All', '', 'Greetings Traveler, I can help you travel back to Thebes or teleport further up to Larissa.'),
    ('Nemea_1_001', 'Nemea_1', 'Antilochos', 'I will never give up halfway for my brothers!'),
    ('Nemea_1_002', 'Nemea_1', 'Automedon', 'Did you see Eurubaies? He is strange recently. Chiron is a sage, I think it''s necessary to ask him to cure Eurubaies with some herbs.'),
    ('Nemea_1_003', 'Nemea_1', 'Eurubaies', 'How handsome!'),
    ('Nemea_1_004', 'Nemea_1', 'Pit', 'What can I do for you? You cannot spread ointment randomly, you must disinfect the scar first.'),
    ('Nemea_1_005', 'Nemea_1', 'Thoma', 'I hope I can open his chest, observe his thoughts and close it. So I can know if he is my friend or not … This is an anonym''s poem.'),
    ('Nemea_1_006', 'Nemea_1', 'Theklas', 'You''re too young to drink! Get out of here before I call the guard…and your mother!'),
    ('Nemea_1_007', 'Nemea_1', 'Philoctetes', 'Hi, I''ve heard of you.'),
    ('Nemea_1_008', 'Nemea_1', 'Chiron', 'Hah, you''re coming.'),
    ('Nemea_1_009', 'Nemea_1', 'Guard', 'Hey, you scared me.'),
    ('Nemea_1_010', 'Nemea_1', 'Captain', 'This country is in danger, but we still have hopes as we have a younger generation like you.'),
    ('Nemea_1_011', 'Nemea_1', 'Village Head', 'Oh, my god! Who will protect our village?'),
    ('Nemea_1_012', 'Nemea_1', 'Lame Guard', 'Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!'),
    ('Nemea_1_013', 'Nemea_1', 'Phoenix', 'It is said that Egyptian Phoenixes will rise from their ashes. My name is related with that immortal bird.'),
    ('Nemea_1_014', 'Nemea_1', '[Props]Prothoos', 'I have some cheap but good things. Please take a look.'),
    ('Nemea_1_015', 'Nemea_1', '[Warehouse]Manager', 'Do you want to deposit things? The warehouse can store lots of materials. It seems there will be a war, now is the time to safely store your valuables.'),
    ('Nemea_1_016', 'Nemea_1', '[Warrior]Diores', 'Want to be an advanced warrior? Don''t forget to update your gear!'),
    ('Nemea_1_017', 'Nemea_1', '[Scholar]Ianassa', 'Scholars have mysterious powers.'),
    ('Nemea_1_018', 'Nemea_1', '[Armor]Tuchios', 'Choose a piece of gear to protect you and decrease the damge caused by monsters. Perseus''s helmet which can make him invisible is famous in Gods War Online, but it belonged to Hades before.'),
    ('Nemea_1_019', 'Nemea_1', '[Jewelry]Spiranthes', 'I want to make ornaments with orchis. Spiranthes is a orchis name.'),
    ('Nemea_1_020', 'Nemea_1', '[Skill]Poluboites', 'Hi, friend. Do you want to improve your fighting ability? Practise with me.'),
    ('Nemea_1_021', 'Nemea_1', 'Telemachos', 'Athena can transform into a person. Maybe she is hiding among us.'),
    ('Nemea_1_022', 'Nemea_1', 'Transporter', 'Dear warrior, I can send you to Sparta or the Suburbs of Sparta, where do you need to go?'),
    ('Nemea_1_023', 'Nemea_1', 'Ancient Relics 3', 'Exchange Sheepskin Scroll 3 for |cffF14187Lost Book Chapter 3|cffffffff.'),
    ('Nemea_1_024', 'Nemea_1', 'Ancient Relics 4', 'Exchange Sheepskin Scroll 4 for |cffF14187Lost Book Chapter 4|cffffffff.'),
    ('Nemea_2_001', 'Nemea_2', '[Round Quest]Forest Issuer', 'I give out the round quest.'),
    ('Nemea_2_002', 'Nemea_2', '[Daily Quest]Forest Issuer', 'Daily quests are a great way to pick up big rewards. Don''t forget to do them every day.'),
    ('Nemea_2_003', 'Nemea_2', 'Eurybia', 'Fight for Sparta. Long live Sparta!'),
    ('Nemea_2_004', 'Nemea_2', 'Thales', 'The 12 constellations have something to do with the gods.'),
    ('Nemea_2_005', 'Nemea_2', 'Pythagoras', 'Math is not only a study of numbers but also a demonstration of wisdom.'),
    ('OfficialPostion', '', '', '|cffFFFF00Official Postion|cffffffff'),
    ('Olympia_All_001', 'Olympia_All', 'Oenomaus', 'Such large scale sports competitions can only be found in Elis. Come to join us. I hope to make competitive sports more popular to the south of Pisa or even the whole of Greece.'),
    ('Olympia_All_002', 'Olympia_All', 'Hippodamia', 'I want to make an olive wreath for our hero with a triumphant smile on his face.'),
    ('Olympia_All_003', 'Olympia_All', 'Pelops', 'Have you ever heard of Lydia which is my hometown. I took part in competitive sports at Olympia when I was still young. I was pretty good at Carriage and Harness Racing'),
    ('Olympia_All_004', 'Olympia_All', 'Chrysippus', 'My father will come back to take part in the sports competition every four years.'),
    ('Olympia_All_005', 'Olympia_All', 'Leucippus', 'I have twin daughters. They are as adorable as Daphne. They have admirers throughout the whole of Acadia. I believe this will put my daughters'' names on everybody''s lips when they come of age.'),
    ('Olympia_All_006', 'Olympia_All', 'Pierus', 'Clio gave birth to my nine daughters. All of them are art fans.'),
    ('Olympia_All_007', 'Olympia_All', 'Pierides', 'Art and sports are equally important. We are writing a song that will be performed at the opening ceremony for the Olympia sports competition.'),
    ('Olympia_All_008', 'Olympia_All', 'Amyclas', 'Apollo has picked my son Hyacinthus. We must send him to Olympia. But it hurts me whenever I think that my son will be far away from me, from Laconia the place where he was born and grew up.'),
    ('Olympia_All_009', 'Olympia_All', 'Hilaeira', 'My father is Leucippus. Phoebe is my little twin sister. She was named after Phoebe who is the Titan goddess of "bright" intellect.'),
    ('Olympia_All_010', 'Olympia_All', 'Phoebe', 'My father is Leucippus. Hilaeira is my big twin sister. She is now crazy about a guy called Pollux.'),
    ('Olympia_All_011', 'Olympia_All', 'Kastor', 'Wow, get them, get them. It must be fair competition. Men must die on the battlefield. Why not join the Argo Volunteer Club.'),
    ('Olympia_All_012', 'Olympia_All', 'Pollux', 'Hilaeira is so beautiful. Phoebe is her twin sister. But I have more feelings for her.'),
    ('Olympia_All_013', 'Olympia_All', 'Idas', 'Kastor is really arrogant. This annoying outsider even wanted to rob me of my cow. I must teach him a lesson with my spear.'),
    ('Olympia_All_014', 'Olympia_All', 'Lynkeus', 'Can you see through this rock. People here are calling me Sharp Eyes.I am the best pilot in the Argo Volunteer Club.'),
    ('Olympia_All_015', 'Olympia_All', 'Cypaissus', 'I am from Mysia in Anatolia Plateau. My home country is in the vicinity of Lydia, Lycia and Troy.'),
    ('Olympia_All_016', 'Olympia_All', 'Daphne', 'There are two fish swimming in this river. They are the incarnations of Aphrodite and Eros.'),
    ('Olympia_All_017', 'Olympia_All', 'Florentina', 'I am a dreamer. I want Iris'' to be growing everwhere at Olympia and the faraway Eastern.'),
    ('Olympia_All_018', 'Olympia_All', 'Athlete', 'Do you want to take part in a sports competition?'),
    ('Olympia_All_019', 'Olympia_All', 'Elijah Hunter', 'The Ionian Sea lies to the west of Elijah. Fish in the sea are the gifts from Poseidon.'),
    ('Olympia_All_020', 'Olympia_All', '[Props]Bernice', 'You must keep yourself at your best. We count on you to bring news of victory to us.'),
    ('Olympia_All_021', 'Olympia_All', 'Churchy Female Priest', 'We will hold a torch lighting and torch relay ceremony. Zeus and Hera are watching us!'),
    ('Olympia_All_022', 'Olympia_All', '[Scholar]Believer', 'The Olympic Games will spread to the east. Do you believe that?'),
    ('Olympia_All_023', 'Olympia_All', '[Warrior]Servant', 'My master is good at various sports.'),
    ('Olympia_All_024', 'Olympia_All', '[Skill]Agent', 'There are lots of relics in Olympia. Have you learnt the skill of praying to gods?'),
    ('Olympia_All_025', 'Olympia_All', '[Jewelry]Clio', 'Have you seen my daughters? I will make them dress up and look beautiful!'),
    ('Olympia_All_026', 'Olympia_All', '[Warehouse]Origin Express', 'Greetings, we are express deliverers. It is our pleasure to help you deliver anything.'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_001', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_002', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_003', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_004', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_005', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_006', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_007', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_008', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_009', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Pan''s Servant', 'Thanks for your visit. I am here to pass out rewards on behalf of my master. You can find him in the center of the labyrinth, along with more surprises!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_010', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Avatar of Pan', 'Greetings, I am Pan, the patron God of the shepherds and the wild. You know I don’t show up in the civilized world very much, nevertheless you have earned rich rewards from me. You can exchange your certificate for gifts from me if you are holding any. Up to ten exchanges are allowed every 24 hours.'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_011', 'Pans_Labyrinth', 'Main City Transporter', 'Do you need to head back to the main city? I can help!'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_a', '', '', 'You have claimed your reward from me. You should go find another servant.'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_b', '', '', 'Not enough space in your bag. Please make room before coming back.'),
    ('Pans_Labyrinth_c', '', '', 'Welcome! I represent Pan and present you this gift. There is a good chance that you will find him in the labyrinth.'),
    ('Parnassus_001', 'Parnassus', 'Frontline Commander', '|cffF14187I am a commander serving on the frontlines.|cffffffff     Apparently you are a brave soldier, because you''ve come to join us here at the front. How about accepting some battle quests to earn big rewards?'),
    ('Parnassus_002', 'Parnassus', 'Frontline Commander', '|cffF14187I am a commander serving on the frontlines.|cffffffff     Apparently you are a brave soldier, because you''ve come to join us here at the front. How about accepting some battle quests to earn big rewards?'),
    ('Parnassus_003', 'Parnassus', 'Capital City Transporter', 'Do you need to return to the capital? I can help!'),
    ('Parnassus_004', 'Parnassus', 'Capital City Transporter', 'Do you need to return to the capital? I can help!'),
    ('Parnitha_1_001', 'Parnitha_1', 'Bias', 'I will never give up halfway through! This is for my brothers!'),
    ('Parnitha_1_002', 'Parnitha_1', 'Telemachus', 'Did you see Philander? He is strange recently. Machaon is Aesculapius''s son, I think it''s necessary to ask him to examine Philander.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_003', 'Parnitha_1', 'Philander', 'How beautiful!'),
    ('Parnitha_1_004', 'Parnitha_1', 'Ctesias', 'What can I do for you? I am a Wolf Killer.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_005', 'Parnitha_1', 'Phaedrus', 'Compared with the gods, it''s better to sit with you face to face. What a pleasant thing to listen to you… This is an anonym''s poem.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_006', 'Parnitha_1', 'Panayiotis', 'No killing wild animals!'),
    ('Parnitha_1_007', 'Parnitha_1', 'Aiputos', 'Hi, I have heard of you.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_008', 'Parnitha_1', '[Props]Machaon', 'I have some cheap but good quality things. Please take a look. My father asked me to open a medicine business on the road before the war. I think it''s a good idea.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_009', 'Parnitha_1', '[Warehouse]Manager', 'I will keep things for you. You can continue on your journey with ease.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_010', 'Parnitha_1', '[Warrior]Eurualos', 'Want to be an advanced warrior? Don''t forget to update your gear!'),
    ('Parnitha_1_011', 'Parnitha_1', '[Scholar]Oreithuia', 'Scholars have mysterious powers.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_012', 'Parnitha_1', '[Armor]Prothoenor', 'Choose a piece of gear to protect you and decrease the damage caused by monsters. Athena''s Aegis is famous in Gods War Online.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_013', 'Parnitha_1', '[Jewelry]Jocasta', 'Aphrodite gave a necklace to Cadmus and Harmonia as a wedding gift. As the necklace will bring disaster to people, it is not for sale.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_014', 'Parnitha_1', 'Orestes', 'Haha, you are coming. There are many mountain paths near Parnitha. Going on an expedition is very difficult.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_015', 'Parnitha_1', 'Guard', 'Hey, you scared me. More and more monster have appeared out of the village.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_016', 'Parnitha_1', 'Captain', 'This country is in danger, but we still have hopes as we have a younger generation to look forward to like you.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_017', 'Parnitha_1', 'Village Head', 'Oh, my god! Who will protect our village?'),
    ('Parnitha_1_018', 'Parnitha_1', 'Wounded Guard', 'Ouch! When will Machaon send medicine to us?'),
    ('Parnitha_1_019', 'Parnitha_1', 'Oedipus', 'It is said that there is a bigger sphinx near Med. I don''t know how many questions she will ask me. By the way, I will tell you a secret: I have seen a small sphinx before, she asked me three questions!'),
    ('Parnitha_1_020', 'Parnitha_1', '[Skill]Novoross', 'Hi, child. Do you want to improve your fighting ability? Practice with me.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_021', 'Parnitha_1', 'Tisamenus', 'When can I go back to Peloponnesus with my father?'),
    ('Parnitha_1_022', 'Parnitha_1', 'Transporter', 'Dear warrior, I can send you to Athens or the Suburbs of Athens, where do you need to go?'),
    ('Parnitha_1_023', 'Parnitha_1', 'Ancient Relics 3', 'Exchange |cff39D8B8Sheepskin Scroll 3|cffffffff for |cff39D8B8Lost Book Chapter 3|cffffffff.'),
    ('Parnitha_1_024', 'Parnitha_1', 'Ancient Relics 4', 'Exchange |cff39D8B8Sheepskin Scroll 4|cffffffff for |cff39D8B8Lost Book Chapter 4|cffffffff.'),
    ('Parnitha_2_001', 'Parnitha_2', '[Round Quest]Port Issuer', 'I give out the round quest.'),
    ('Parnitha_2_002', 'Parnitha_2', '[Daily Quest]Port Issuer', 'Daily quests are a great way to pick up big rewards. Don''t forget to do them every day.'),
    ('Parnitha_2_003', 'Parnitha_2', 'Themistocles', 'Fight for Athens. Long live Athens!'),
    ('Parnitha_2_004', 'Parnitha_2', 'Herodotus', 'History is a record of the flow of time, but I don''t merely study time.'),
    ('Parnitha_2_005', 'Parnitha_2', 'Ephialtes', 'Keeping Parnitha Port safe is fundamental to resisting the Persian invaders.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_001', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Varnava', 'You are coming. A good day, isn''t it? But I feel like something is missing…'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_002', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Annis', 'My younger sister Teresa likes going out and now I cannot find her.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_003', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Basileiou', 'You can visit the splendid temple in the main city. Brave people will receive the gods''oracle.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_004', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Teresa', 'Little dog… is lost…'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_005', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Koronos', 'I will guard people.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_006', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Meges', 'I am patrolling, what are you doing?'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_007', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Muropis', 'I like charging in the front.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_008', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Gerasimou', 'A lot of soldiers have been arriving recently, will there be a war?'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_009', 'Peloponnese_All', '[Props]Aithra', 'Hey, various medicines are available. Do you need some?'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_010', 'Peloponnese_All', 'War Supplier 3', 'You should submit War Material 1 through War Material 4 in sequence together with your guild members. After that, you will obtain rewards. In addition, your guild will obtain extra rewards. You can also hand in the materials to |cffF14187War Supplier 1|cffffffff in the main city or |cffF14187War Supplier 2|cffffffff in the suburbs of Sparta.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_011', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Ancient Relics 2', 'Exchange Sheepskin Scroll 2 for |cffF14187Lost Book Chapter 2|cffffffff.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_012', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Ancient Relics 5', 'Exchange Sheepskin Scroll 5 for |cffF14187Lost Book Chapter 5|cffffffff.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_013', 'Peloponnese_All', '[Spartan Cadian] General Lykaios', 'If you have more Cadian Plates, feel free to exchange them with me for experience points.'),
    ('Peloponnese_All_014', 'Peloponnese_All', 'Key Collector', 'I''ve collected some pieces of the key. You can claim them during the event time, and then use them to unlock the IGG Anniversary Chest.                                                           Location of the IGG Anniversary Envoy                          Sparta (158,69)                                                      Athens (158,69)'),
    ('Plataea_All_001', 'Plataea_All', '[Props]Alex', 'Hi, warrior, what do you need? Palm can be used to make oilseed.'),
    ('Plataea_All_002', 'Plataea_All', 'Fellmonger', 'Good sheepskin can be used to make durable scrolls.'),
    ('Plataea_All_003', 'Plataea_All', 'Thracian Mercenary', 'Thrace is a wide area in the northeast of Greece. Many tribes are living there and lots of people have noble Greek blood.'),
    ('Plataea_All_004', 'Plataea_All', 'Cronus Captain', 'Ismene is Antigone''s sister. All Cadmeia people know they are good sisters.'),
    ('Plataea_All_005', 'Plataea_All', 'Amphitryon', 'Sthenleus dispelled me out of my homeland. Luckily, all my children become heroes.'),
    ('Plataea_All_006', 'Plataea_All', 'Cephalus', 'My wife Procris has a gundog which belonged to Minos before.'),
    ('Plataea_All_007', 'Plataea_All', 'Procris', 'I got a wizard spear from Minos. Minos has many brothers but he has driven them away from Crete.'),
    ('Plataea_All_008', 'Plataea_All', 'Spartan Assassin', 'You can submit poisons to me in an attempt to assassinate the hostile Consul.'),
    ('RecallChairman', '', '', '|cffFFFF00Dismiss Lord|cffffffff'),
    ('Salary', '', '', '|cffFFFF00Salary|cffffffff'),
    ('Sell', '', '', '|cffFFFF00Trade|cffffffff'),
    ('Sicily_001', 'Sicily', 'Athens Transporter', 'Want to return to Athens?'),
    ('Sicily_002', 'Sicily', 'Sparta Transporter', 'Want to return to Sparta?'),
    ('Sicily_003', 'Sicily', 'Athenian Quest Envoy', 'Welcome to Sicily, please choose a place suitable for you.'),
    ('Sicily_004', 'Sicily', 'Spartan Quest Envoy', 'Welcome to Sicily, please choose a place suitable for you.'),
    ('Sicily_005', 'Sicily', 'Sicily Merchant', 'Alas, I don''t know who I am or where I was from either. My task is to deliver these |cff39D8B8 Mystic Seals|cffffffff to brave persons who come here. These Mystic Seals initiate |cffF14187 a quest that rewards tons of talent points|cffffffff.'),
    ('Sicily_006', 'Sicily', 'Sicily Merchant', 'Alas, I don''t know who I am or where I was from either. My task is to deliver these |cfff79709 Mystic Seals|cffffffff to brave persons who come here. These Mystic Seals initiate |cfff79709 a quest that rewards tons of talent points|cffffffff.'),
    ('Sparta_001', 'Sparta', 'Pelagias', 'Improving the public order should be your top priority right now.'),
    ('Sparta_002', 'Sparta', 'Asteriou', 'Hey,what can I do for you? I am Captain, although it''s a junior military title in Sparta, I love my job.'),
    ('Sparta_003', 'Sparta', 'Nathanail', 'What can I do for you? I am patrolling. I''ll tell you a secret: The vendors in the logistical distribution center are all sea fairies. Nereus has 50 daughters.'),
    ('Sparta_004', 'Sparta', 'Zeno', 'Do you want to listen to my melody?... It would be better if I have a lyre.'),
    ('Sparta_005', 'Sparta', 'Eeria', 'I am searching for various flower seeds. In Greece, many flower names have their own history.'),
    ('Sparta_006', 'Sparta', 'Claudios', 'If there is no law, the world would fall into anarchy…Sparta Parliament have various rights over the king. If the king breaks the law, he will also be punished.'),
    ('Sparta_007', 'Sparta', 'Kleopatras', 'I will be a great man like my teacher.'),
    ('Sparta_008', 'Sparta', 'Ikaros', 'Technic has no borders. I hope all Greek craftsmen can unite and build the greatest |cffecf0b2building|cffffffff and |cffecf0b2statue|cffffffff.'),
    ('Sparta_009', 'Sparta', 'Amvrosiou', 'Sparta is a city with a long history. Peloponnesus is mountainous and our city is located in the crevice. It seems we have natural protection.'),
    ('Sparta_010', 'Sparta', 'Petara', 'Hi, I haven''t seen you before… Do you want some wine? Wini Wine is very popular now.'),
    ('Sparta_011', 'Sparta', '[Priest]Diotima', 'The Olympian gods bless you… All gods are relatives of 99Zeus, but they don''t get along very good.'),
    ('Sparta_012', 'Sparta', 'Thanksgiving Envoy', 'Happy Thanksgiving Day, my brave fighters! Could you bring me some turkey meat and Thanksgiving Gift Certificates? If you do, I will reward you handsomely. If you also bring me one Thanksgiving Greetings Card, you will get even more rewards. Go ahead, there are a lot of turkeys just waiting for you to chase them in the Peloponnese_All.'),
    ('Sparta_013', 'Sparta', 'Stamatis', 'Have you ever found treasures? If you know some clues, please tell me! I like geological prospecting. The king of Mycenae has a Golden Mask, but I don''t know where it is.'),
    ('Sparta_014', 'Sparta', 'Gorgias', 'Er, haven''t I seen you before? You are a newcomer, right?...'),
    ('Sparta_015', 'Sparta', 'Helen', 'Don''t touch me. It''s not interesting here.'),
    ('Sparta_016', 'Sparta', 'Jason', 'When you decide to love someone, don''t let them go. My dear Medea is not happy recently and has gone to Athens. I must get her back. Any good ideas?'),
    ('Sparta_017', 'Sparta', 'Atalanta', 'Which god do you like? Have you seen Nefen''s Servant? They all live in hotspring.'),
    ('Sparta_018', 'Sparta', 'Postman', 'Doing the legwork is very tired, but I think it''s interesting, because I can make more friends.'),
    ('Sparta_019', 'Sparta', 'Achilles', 'Sparta is a good place. So is Athens to the northeast of Sparta. But they are engaged in war now.'),
    ('Sparta_020', 'Sparta', '[Sage]Neo', 'A sage must be wise and never give up!'),
    ('Sparta_021', 'Sparta', 'Hyacinthus', 'We are like beautiful flowers looking at Apollo''s light! Brightening the whole Laconia Plain.'),
    ('Sparta_022', 'Sparta', '[Warehouse]Manager', 'Do you want to |cffF14187store items|cffffffff? If you don''t have enough space in your backpack, why not deposit them here?'),
    ('Sparta_023', 'Sparta', '[Warehouse]Haides', 'After the logistics develop, I will suggest they form the |cffF14187Peloponnesus Trade Bank|cffffffff. Thus,the |cffF14187Military Alliance in Sparta will become stronger.'),
    ('Sparta_024', 'Sparta', '[Guild] Instance Supervisor', 'The Guild instance is currently not active.'),
    ('Sparta_025', 'Sparta', 'Oriental Cuisine Master', '|cffF14187Welcome, to our Mooncake Exchange this Mid-Autumn Festival!|cFFFFFFFF                Hail, my friend! I come a long way from the East, and I must say I have definite interest in Greek cuisine! Do you happen to have a Greek Cuisine Recipe with you? If not, I know a few ways you could get one! 1) At 2:00AM, 6:00AM, 10:00AM, 2:00PM, 6:00PM and 10:00PM daily, the Artemis Treasure Chest Leader will appear in the wilds - defeat him to get one!  2) Exchange Delicate Mooncakes with the Lunar Priest, and you might get one too!             If you already have a Greek Cuisine Recipe, you can exchange it with me for a Delicate Mooncake quest scroll!'),
    ('Sparta_026', 'Sparta', 'Lunar Priest', '|cffF14187 Welcome to the Mid-Autumn wish-making event! |cFFFFFFFFI heard an Oriental Cuisine Master is in town, and he is an expert at making delicate mooncakes as offerings to Artemis, the goddess of the moon. Can you bring me back some of these delicious mooncakes? I promise rich rewards for your effort.|cFFF79709 Rewards: |cFFFFFFFFCharacter Exp, Pet Exp, Character TP, Energy Zodiac.|cFFF79709 Starts: |cFFFFFFFFToday|cFFF79709Ends: |cFFFFFFFFPlease stay tuned for upcoming announcements on our official website.'),
    ('Sparta_027', 'Sparta', 'Actor', 'I want to found a band.'),
    ('Sparta_028', 'Sparta', '[Warrior]Patroklos', 'Where is the war, where is the bloodshed? You should protect yourself when fighting bravely.'),
    ('Sparta_029', 'Sparta', '[Scholar]Agaue', 'Have you ever heard Orestes? He is the Mycenaean Prince, but we have information that he has escaped to Athens with his servant Pylades.'),
    ('Sparta_030', 'Sparta', '[Jewelry]Goldsmith', 'Please buy some beautiful jewelry. They are all made by myself. There is a  vulture on Ares'' shield.'),
    ('Sparta_031', 'Sparta', '[Armor]Daidalos', 'Three cobblers equal a rich man. Fable  says, the rich will get used to the cobbler''s smell after living together.'),
    ('Sparta_032', 'Sparta', 'Wanted Quest Issuer', 'If you''ve reached Level 50 and you wish to take on a wanted quest, come see me before 9:00pm. I can help you by issuing up to 5 wanted quests each day. Once the wanted quest you''ve taken on has been completed and turned in to the Wanted Quest Assesor, you will be rewarded. You can also help with wanted quests others have taken on, but you can only complete 5 wanted quests at most on any single day.'),
    ('Sparta_033', 'Sparta', 'Pindus Master', 'During 11:00am to 11:45am Wed. and Sun. 9:00pm to 9:45pm Sat,the transporter beside me can send you to the Pindus Mountain Battlefield.'),
    ('Sparta_034', 'Sparta', '[Skill]Ajax', 'Although Ajax.E is brave, I will try my best to surpass him. Why not come with me?'),
    ('Sparta_035', 'Sparta', 'Santa Claus', 'Ho ho ho! The season of giving is here! Have you been good this year? Bring me some holiday cheer, and I might have a special gift waiting just for you.'),
    ('Sparta_036', 'Sparta', '[Props]Aglaia', 'You should take enough |cffF14187potion|cffffffff to sustain your strength. I have many kinds to choose from.'),
    ('Sparta_037', 'Sparta', '[Armor]Cobbler Trainee', 'My master is not only skillful, but also intelligent. Do you want some |cffF14187armor|cffffffff? They are all fashionable.'),
    ('Sparta_038', 'Sparta', '[Jewelry]Artisan', 'To forge |cffF14187Metal containers|cffffffff you must use a very high temperature. You can master it after learning for a period. But processing and enchasing |cffF14187gems|cffffffff requires skill and patience. Not everyone can do it.'),
    ('Sparta_039', 'Sparta', '[Guild] Quest Supervisor', 'All Guild members must help build up the Guild. Do this by completing any of my quests, and we will keep your contributions in mind.'),
    ('Sparta_040', 'Sparta', '[Daily Quest]Main City Issuer', 'Hi, please pray for Ares every week so that you will get his blessing.'),
    ('Sparta_041', 'Sparta', '[Polis Quest]Issuer', 'Warriors, are you ready? Fight for Sparta.'),
    ('Sparta_042', 'Sparta', 'Transporter', 'I can send you to a remote place, but I suggest you reach a certain level before going there.'),
    ('Sparta_043', 'Sparta', 'Senator', 'Hey, boy, why do you point at me? Do you want to join the council? You need more training.'),
    ('Sparta_044', 'Sparta', 'Class Shifter', 'In Greece, you can choose to be a Warrior, Champion, Mage or Priest. Each of these classes have their own strong points.   If you are Level 100 or below, I am willing to shift your class to another and also shift your equipped items into items specific to the new class for free. If you are above Level 100, you should hand me 1 |cff39D8B8Class Shift Permit|cffffffff, otherwise I won''t help you to shift your class.'),
    ('Sparta_045', 'Sparta', 'Citizen', 'Do you know how to distinguish the direction in the fog? I pray for wind to dispel the fog…'),
    ('Sparta_046', 'Sparta', 'Wanted Quest Assessor', 'Do you need my help to turn in a completed wanted quest? Once you''ve completed one wanted quest, I will reward you with one medal, which can be exchanged with the Wanted Warrant Issuer beside me for a variety of cool items.'),
    ('Sparta_047', 'Sparta', 'Spartan Traveler', 'I find an unbelievable phenomenon here: People throw children to the outdoors and let them learn survival skills. Now the place where people throw children is called "|cff3ac5efMount Taygetos|cffffffff".'),
    ('Sparta_048', 'Sparta', 'Retired Wizard', 'I have seen lots of relics. It''s not so great! Pentacle is the symbol of Kore. The Star of David is the seal of the Jews from the desert land far away.'),
    ('Sparta_049', 'Sparta', '[Guild] Guild Reg', 'Hey, traveler, I am |cffF14187Menetheus|cffffffff, the Spartan Guild Registrar. As long as you have reached level |cffF1418730|cffffffff and possess a "|cff39D8B8Guild Stone|cffffffff", I will approve the founding of your guild so that numerous Greek fighters will gather around you. If a guild lord is offline for |cffF1418715|cffffffff consecutive days, any guild member can apply to |cffF14187dismiss the lord|cffffffff. After the application is successful, a new guild lord will be elected according to members'' position and Gold contribution.'),
    ('Sparta_050', 'Sparta', '[Guild]Alter Supervisor', 'Now I am in charge of communication between you and gods. Ares will bless all the Spartan warriors.'),
    ('Sparta_051', 'Sparta', '[Guild] Member Advisor', 'As a member of the guild, you are entitled to all the benefits of membership. Come here for weekly prayer to double your EXP and talent points.'),
    ('Sparta_052', 'Sparta', '[Exchange]Mentor', 'Everyone thinks I am a fisherman, but I know Athena. What do you want to exchange for?'),
    ('Sparta_053', 'Sparta', 'Halloween Envoy', 'Happy Halloween! Everybody will be able to get a beautiful Halloween suit from me on this day each year. I also have plenty of pumpkin candy to give away……Oh, where is it?……where''s my pumpkin candy?……The little candies played a trick on me! They have changed into devils and flown to the main city to cause trouble. Put on your Halloween suit and catch them using the mysteriously powerful Halloween wand. Catch them and I''ll reward you well.'),
    ('Sparta_054', 'Sparta', 'Retrieving Officer', 'To increase the efficiency of camp construction, I gather various kinds of resources from citizens on behalf of the country on a random basis. Just bring your resources to us if you need to exchange them. Satisfactory terms and conditions are guaranteed! The first phase of the Hermes Stone recycling program will conclude soon, and the second phase of the Life Essence and Crystal recycling program has officially begun. Remember, these programs don''t last long, so please make a quick move if you''d like to exchange your resources!'),
    ('Sparta_055', 'Sparta', 'Faction Crier', 'War is imminent! In order to tally the number of soldiers fit for duty, the general has asked me to distribute |cff39D8B8one Nameplate|cffffffff to each Athenian warrior |cffF14187every day|cffffffff from |cffF14187Monday|cffffffff to |cffF14187Saturday|cffffffff. The Nameplates can be exchanged for |cffF14187Talent Points|cffffffff and |cffF14187Exp|cffffffff. Come improve your fighting abilities in defense of our beloved Sparta!'),
    ('Sparta_056', 'Sparta', 'Battlefield Transporter', 'Our war with the Athenians has raged for a generation – from the Pindus Mountain to the Lelantine Farm. Euboea have always been good friends with us, but now they are being attacked by our enemies. We cannot stand by idly. From |cffF14187 10:45pm and 11:30pm|cffffffff on Saturdays, you can enter the Lelantine Farm to teach those Athenians a lesson. Notes: |cffF14187 Claim your rewards for the fight before 11:55pm, or else you will forfeit them.|cffffffff'),
    ('Sparta_057', 'Sparta', '[Village Leader]Stefanos', 'I am not a native. My current appearance is not my real appearance. Nevertheless, I am always pleased to help. As a matter of fact, the centaurs here have never been very peaceful. I''ve often wondered when the centaurs will be able to live peacefully like us humans.'),
    ('Sparta_057_a', '', '', 'You are an eligible Spartan warrior, so Ares will endow you with a Portal Scroll. However, your backpack is full, tidy it up first.'),
    ('Sparta_057_b', '', '', 'You are an eligible Spartan warrior! Ares will now endow you with a portal scroll which can teach you how to go to Peloponnesus instantly. In addition, I will giving you a [Riding] book which can teach how you riding skills.'),
    ('Sparta_057_c', '', '', 'You don''t have enough training. Claim a Portal Scroll from me when you are Level 40.'),
    ('Sparta_058', 'Sparta', 'Cupid', 'I am Cupid, the god of love and beauty. If you wish to marry your sweetheart then you can get engaged to them here. Then you must go to get a Whelk Necklace for me from Pan''s Maze. Remember to apply to get married once you''ve got the necklace. I am not free every day, you know.                                             |cffF14187 Notes: It''s the man''s responsibility to submit the applications to get engaged, married or to commence the wedding ceremony.'),
    ('Sparta_059', 'Sparta', 'Wedding Priest', 'I am Cupid''s right hand man. Weddings should be exciting and fun. If you want to make a wedding go with a bang come don''t forget to bring some red packets and fireworks!'),
    ('Sparta_060', 'Sparta', 'Instance Caller', 'Come find me if you want to enter an instance! For a more challenging task, visit the Training Ground, but remember, you need to be at least level |cffF1418740|cffffffff to qualify.  For the ultimate adventure, join the Medusa Challenge, but you need to be at least level |cffF1418790|cffffffff to participate. It is a new instance which is located at sea. Great rewards, including Honor that can be exchanged for better items, await those with the courage to fight for them.'),
    ('Sparta_061', 'Sparta', 'Labyrinth Quest Envoy', 'Zeus'' lover has been kidnapped. Can you do the Thundergod a favor? I suppose Zeus can wait till you are |cffF14187level 50|cffffffff…'),
    ('Sparta_062', 'Sparta', 'Sicily Refugee', 'Sicily has gone to hell, damned Hades! In order to purify and rebuild Sicily, we must destroy the inhuman monsters there.'),
    ('Sparta_063', 'Sparta', '[Guild] Event Supervisor', 'Sorry,I''m busy.'),
    ('Sparta_064', 'Sparta', 'King of Newbies', 'During the Alpha Test, they bravely slaughtered monsters with the zeal of a veteran, while also fearlessly completing the most difficult quests. Truly the best of the best.                    |cffF14187Ranking: Level|cffffffff                                                   |cffF14187Athens|cffffffff:                                                             Talia                                                           Siphon                                                              Kaylor                                                         Anabolim                                                        Mikali                                                               Auxi                                                            Cupcake                                                         bKeios                                                          misutka                                                         Celestia                                                        |cffF14187Sparta|cffffffff:                                                              Agha                                                                 BladeX                                                              Doko                                                              Drag0nPa                                                             AnkleR                                                              Twix                                                                 Krayzie                                                             Loke                                                                Pale                                                             Eldin'),
    ('Sparta_065', 'Sparta', 'Exterminator', 'During the Alpha Test, they made it their priority to make GodsWar the best game it could be. They tirelessly catalogued the flaws that needed to be polished before GodsWar could be what it has grown into today.                                            |cffF141871st Prize|cffffffff:                                                           Fenrir                                                               |cffF141872nd Prize|cffffffff:                                                          Harry                                                                Dryburgh                                                             |cffF141873rd Prize|cffffffff:                                                           Sneike                                                               Goddess                                                              Silver                                                               Rary                                                                 Odysseus                                                             Kekze                                                                Eldin                                                                Glory                                                                Chiyame                                                              Chaos                                                                |cffF14187Encouragement Prize|cffffffff:                                                Graith                                                               Rary                                                                 do_Ob                                                                Madness                                                             Tempo                                                               BubbleoO                                                          llion81                                                              Marigold                                                             Mordrek                                                              Allanon                                                              Faye                                                                 Adrastos                                                             Sherazou                                                            Ambrose'),
    ('Sparta_066', 'Sparta', 'King of Fighters', 'During the Alpha Test, they were the first to run into the fray and the last to stop swinging their sword. They faced monsters and rival factions with the same determination to win.    |cffF14187Ranking:Reputation|cffffffff                                                   |cffF14187Athens|cffffffff:                                                              Mikali                                                               Siphon                                                               Adrastos                                                             Keios                                                                Fenrir                                                               |cffF14187Sparta|cffffffff:                                                              Leonidas                                                             Agha                                                                 LingChen                                                             BladeX                                                               Twix'),
    ('Sparta_067', 'Sparta', 'Forge Master', 'During the Alpha Test, they created excellent weapons throughout the whole Greece and became true forge masters.                 |cffF141871st Prize|cffffffff:                                                           Agha                                                                 |cffF141872nd Prize|cffffffff:                                                           Joan                                                                 Keitegg                                                              |cffF141873rd Prize|cffffffff:                                                           siphon                                                               Naheb                                                                Iceman                                                               !DeMoN!                                                              Hime'),
    ('Sparta_068', 'Sparta', 'B-GOLD Shop', 'Hey, come here! I have a wide range of goods. If you pay me with |cffF14187Bound Gold|cffffffff, I will give you some rare things.'),
    ('Sparta_069', 'Sparta', 'Teaching Manager', 'More and more people enter this ancient world everyday, but I am afraid they may get lost. When you''ve reached |cffF14187Level 50|cffffffff, you can apply to be a master and teach the newbies what you know, besides, they will receive |cffF14187special rewards|cffffffff from the Gods. One master can have up to |cffF141876 apprentices|cffffffff who are below |cffF14187Level 50|cffffffff. If they form a team, the master will gain Masters Ethics with the improvement of apprentices.'),
    ('Sparta_070', 'Sparta', 'Gear Mentor', 'Hephaestus is my master. Although I am not as skilful as him, I look more handsome. Yeah, I can help you enhance your gear, but don''t tell my master.'),
    ('Sparta_071', 'Sparta', 'Title Expert', 'Hi, you can obtain your attribute and class titles from me! I will also reward you if you win some special titles!'),
    ('Sparta_072', 'Sparta', 'Event Transporter', 'Labyrinth       |cffF14187Anytime|cffffffff                     50-140     Everyday Treasure Land   |cffF1418710:00pm - 11:00pm|cffffffff          60-140         Sun      Cursed Zone               |cffF14187any time|cffffffff          55-140       Everyday  Sicily           |cffF1418710:00pm - 12:00pm|cffffffff          25-140       Fri;     Pan''s Labyrinth  |cffF1418712:00pm - 6:00pm|cffffffff          70-140      Weekends Trojan Expedition   |cffF141878:00pm - 9:00pm|cffffffff        50-140      Thur      Romance Island   |cffF141878:30pm - 9:00pm|cffffffff            70-140       Wed/Sat  You can also enter Sicily at any time with a Mystic Spell except Fridays.  Romance Island is accessible 4:30pm--5:00pm on Sundays'),
    ('Sparta_073', 'Sparta', 'Battlefield Awarder', 'Please claim the rewards between |cffF1418711：45am-11:55pm|cffffffff on Wednesdays and Sundays, and |cffF141879:45pm-11:55pm|cffffffff on Saturdays after the battlefield event ends.'),
    ('Sparta_074', 'Sparta', 'Wishing Pool', 'This is a Wishing Pool. It is said that it will grant player''s wishes.'),
    ('Sparta_075', 'Sparta', 'Fortune Teller', 'As an oracle in touch with the divine power of the Gods, I can change your zodiac and grant you extraordinary luck for one day. However, I must use my divine power so the lucky time will be limited.'),
    ('Sparta_076', 'Sparta', 'War Supplier 1', 'You can hand in any war materials to me, but I won''t pay much. However, you can send the war materials to |cffF14187War Supplier 2|cffffffff in the suburbs or |cffF14187War Supplier 3|cffffffff in Peloponnesus, they may give you higher prices.'),
    ('Sparta_077', 'Sparta', 'Point Exchanger', 'If you have enough points, you can come find me and exchange for rewards that will help enhance your equipment.'),
    ('Sparta_078', 'Sparta', 'Fitness Trainer 6', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_079', 'Sparta', 'Fitness Trainer 7', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_080', 'Sparta', 'Fitness Trainer 8', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_081', 'Sparta', 'Fitness Trainer 9', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_082', 'Sparta', 'Fitness Trainer 10', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_083', 'Sparta', 'Mysterious Elder', 'I am an old man. Don''t ask where I''m from or where I''ll go ''cuz I wouldn''t tell you even if I knew. I am here to retrieve the Lost Book, so I will be able to give you one |cff39D8B8Sheepskin Scroll 7|cFFFFFFFF everyday. You need to get the other scrolls from the Boogyman that respawns every 2 hrs in the surburbs. Beware their leaders, because they usually have a |cff39D8B8Sheepskin Scroll 7|cFFFFFFFF on them. Follow the instructions on the scroll to find the corresponding Lost Book Chapters. Once you have collected them, I can help you piece them together into a fullversion of the Lost Book, and with it, you can obtain great rewards at the Wishing Pool.'),
    ('Sparta_084', 'Sparta', 'Festival Envoy', 'I am the Festival Envoy, and during the festivities, players who reach Level 30 can come to me and claim a small gift. |cffF14187In addition, all players can come to me and claim EXP fun time every weekend.|cffffffff'),
    ('Sparta_085', 'Sparta', 'Master Vestment Forger', 'Don''t call me Master Vestment Forger. Or else, I will be ashamed because the craft to forge vestments was invented by Hephaestus, the god of fire and metal-working, but I have merely mastered superficial knowledge of the craft.'),
    ('Sparta_086', 'Sparta', 'Holy Stone Artisan', 'Hey, adventurer, have you ever heard the ana "The vestment that has not been improved by a holy stone is not a good vestment"? Errr, I''ve forgotten which celebrity first said that. Anyway, he is right. Why not improve your vestments with holy stones now?'),
    ('Sparta_087', 'Sparta', 'Bound Gold Vendor', 'I am selling good stuffs. Traveler, why not browse my goods? Just give me some |cffF14187 Bound Gold|cffffffff, I will give you some rare items in return. Don''t tell this secret to others, okay?'),
    ('Sparta_088', 'Sparta', 'Pet Manager', 'I am a mage from Temple of Artemis on Delos Island. I''m able to communicate with pets. Bring me a pet, and I can help you prepare a |cff39D8B8Soul Contract|cffffffff, which allows you to |cff39D8B8merge|cffffffff a pet with another to concentrate their power, or allows your pet to be |cff39D8B8reborn|cffffffff; both paths are designed to strengthrn your pet. If you can get |cff39D8B8Pixie''s Tear|cffffffff, I can reveal the pet''s hidden growth rate. If you have |cff39D8B8Seal Jade (empty)|cffffffff, I can seal your pet for trade if it hasn''t been |cffF14187bounded|cffffffff to you.'),
    ('Sparta_089', 'Sparta', 'Pet Merchant', 'Have you ever heard about the Sphinx? It''s an Egyptian pharaoh''s pet. Just browse my goods, I am able to make your pet even stronger than the Sphinx.'),
    ('Sparta_090', 'Sparta', 'Pan''s Envoy', 'Pan sent me here to assist those brave warriors who wish to visit his labyrinth! Give me all 6 invitation parts, and I will give you an invitation letter and a certificate that can be redeemed for a free gift!'),
    ('Sparta_091', 'Sparta', 'Cupid''s Shadow', 'I am Cupid''s shadow. I''m always on the opposite side of Cupid. For example, I''ve been really busy lately handling applications for broken engagements and divorces. Ha-ha nothing lasts for ever!'),
    ('Sparta_092', 'Sparta', 'Spring Festival Envoy', 'Happy Spring Festival! This year, Valentine''s Day will be during Spring Festival. Love and renewal are in the air, but some annoying |cffF14187Snow Demons|cffffffff have begun attacking Sparta! The nerve of these beast! They have already reached the suburbs of Sparta. We must prevent them from invading the city! Brave adventurers, go destroy the |cffF14187 Snow Demons|cffffffff. They will drop a lot of cool stuff when killed that you can then exchange with me for cool rewards.'),
    ('Sparta_093', 'Sparta', '[Round Quest]Main City Issuer', 'I give out the round quest.'),
    ('Sparta_094', 'Sparta', '[Newbie Guide]', 'Hello. You will benefit a lot from communicating with friends. Please left click on an NPC and choose a function from the user menu after clicking a player. You can click quest target to |cff3ac5efAuto-trace|cffffffff after accepting a quest. Is it easy?'),
    ('Sparta_095', 'Sparta', '[Props Merchant]Zinoviou', 'Haha, I have everything that you expect to find. Come to buy it!'),
    ('Sparta_096', 'Sparta', '[Warrior Supplier]Simonos', 'Hi, warrior! I have all kinds of weapons for you to choose from.'),
    ('Sparta_097', 'Sparta', 'Viktoros', 'Forging gear is manual labor and inlaying is mental labor. If you are not careful, it will…|cffebed99Hephaestus|cffffffff is our Ironsmiths''s patron saint. Lots of legendary weapons were made by him.'),
    ('Sparta_098', 'Sparta', 'Ion', 'Hello. There is no special event in the village today. When your level increases, you can accept a quest from the person who has a "|cfffaa955question mark above their head|cffffffff".'),
    ('Sparta_099', 'Sparta', '[Skill Merchant]Thisbe', 'There are lots of |cfff26659monsters|cffffffff outside the newbie camp, trying to defeat them is the best training.'),
    ('Sparta_100', 'Sparta', '[Warehouse]Savva', 'Hi, warehouses can be used to deposit items, do you want to do so? There is an |cfffdd3b9Argo|cffffffff at the foot of Pelion. It is made by many craftsmen under the guidance of Athena.'),
    ('Sparta_101', 'Sparta', 'Foka', 'How are you, my dear friend?'),
    ('Sparta_102', 'Sparta', '[Armor Merchant]Judaeus', 'Prepare enough materials before fighting against monsters, so you can win. Are you ready? I have a variety of armor, have a look!'),
    ('Sparta_103', 'Sparta', 'Artem', 'I am good at painting buildings.'),
    ('Sparta_104', 'Sparta', 'Fanouriou', 'It is very important for a warrior to sustain physical strength. Do you want to buy some potions?'),
    ('Sparta_105', 'Sparta', 'Odysseus', 'We don''t fight alone. Have you ever heard of the |cfffaa955Argo Volunteer Club|cffffffff?  I am a member…'),
    ('Sparta_106', 'Sparta', 'Acacia', 'I am a stranger, it''s not my true face, but I will give my helping hand if I am needed.'),
    ('Sparta_107', 'Sparta', '[Scholar Supplier]Ianeira', 'A wise scholar needs cool gear. Don''t forget to update!'),
    ('Sparta_108', 'Sparta', '[Jewelry Merchant]Glauce', 'I come from |cff3ac5efCorinth|cffffffff. Do you know the sea is green, so my name is Glauce.'),
    ('Sparta_109', 'Sparta', 'Apothecary', '|cffF14187I am an apothecary.|cffffffff                                                To exchange gems or crystals for exp potions, or transfer potions, come see me.'),
    ('Sparta_110', 'Sparta', 'Pet Master', 'I am sent by Hera to distribute pet eggs to people of this world. Once you have an egg, click on it to hatch your baby pet.'),
    ('Sparta_111', 'Sparta', 'Spring Merrymaker', 'In order to enjoy a peaceful Spring Festival, we must defeat the Lunar Beast. This is not too difficult, but it is not without dangers. To get started we must first lure it out. People say the best way to lure this monster out from the shadows is with Spring Festival Firecrackers. This is where you come in. I need some special goods for Spring Festival, and if you bring them to me I will reward you with Spring Festival Firecrackers. If you want to learn more about how to find the Lunar Beast, talk with the Lunar Beast Slayer beside me.'),
    ('Sparta_112', 'Sparta', 'Lunar Beast Slayer', 'Great, now''s my time to shine. First, get some Spring Festival Firecrackers from the Spring Merrymaker beside me. I will lure the Lunar Beast out when I''ve lit enough Spring Festival Firecrackers, then we can defeat it together. I''ll even reward you for bringing it down. Do you want a fantastic Flying Carpet or a cute snowman?'),
    ('Sparta_113', 'Sparta', '[Event]Zeus'' Loyal Believer', 'The Almighty Zeus rules over the Olympian Gods with wisdom and gives us strength. I am unable to give him anything in return, except my gratitude and loyal service. Would you like to do the same? Zeus will know of your devotion and give you blessings in return. Also, the more gifts you deliver, the greater the rewards - even double on the weekends! Just a hint, the |cffF14187 Cursed Zone |cffffffff and |cffF14187 Treasure Land |cffffffff have many of Zeus'' favorite gifts.'),
    ('Sparta_114', 'Sparta', '[Event]Praying Saint', 'Dear friend, you must always keep mind that without Zeus'' blessings we cannot live a good life at all. During every |cffF14187 0:00PM Saturday and 11:55PM Sunday|cffffffff, Zeus always commands me to give out innumerous precious treasures, including a great deal of experience and talent points. If you want to get them, you must first offer Zeus |cffF14187Praying Stone|cffffffff.'),
    ('Sparta_115', 'Sparta', 'Mid-autumn Gift Pack Giver', 'Provide a Mid-autumn Festival Gift Pack Dollar to me, and you will get a great gift pack containing Level 2 Crystal*50,  Greater Pixie Bag*1,  Level 3 Ruby*3, Level 3 Sapphire *3, Level 3 Emerald *3, Energy Holy Water*10, 10 of each a variety of Enduring Potion, Golden Iris*20, Super Healing Potion*99,  Super Mana Potion*99, Mysterious String Bag *10, Super Firework*5, Anima Potion*10 and pieces of a Magic Jade of the rare Blue Crystal Dragon.'),
    ('Sparta_116', 'Sparta', 'Mount Feeder', 'I am the best mount feeder in all of Greece. Just get your mount here in one piece, and I''ll take care of the rest.'),
    ('Sparta_117', 'Sparta', 'Easter Bunny Envoy', 'Come on! Get those naughty |cffF14187 Bunnies|cffffffff for me! The|cffF14187 Bunnies|cffffffff will spawn |cffF14187 Easter Eggs|cffffffff. Turn in the eggs to me for prizes. The prizes are available |cffF14187 1 hour |cffffffff after the|cffF14187 Bunny |cffffffff turns up. An extra |cffF14187 Weak Bunny|cffffffff will go to the player who turns in the largest number of Easter Eggs. The prizes must be claimed before the next round of |cffF14187 Bunnies|cffffffff spawn, or they will be forfeited. Only |cffF14187 Lvl 20+|cffffffff players are allowed participate in the Bunny busting event.'),
    ('Sparta_118', 'Sparta', 'Random Quest Manager', 'You will receive a Quest Sack from me to complete the Scroll Quest. After the quest is complete you will be rewarded with an Exp Pill and a chance at a Morning Dew. Each round includes 10 quests, the more quests you complete the more rewards you will receive. After completing the 10th quest, you will be rewarded with an extra Talent Stone 3.'),
    ('Sparta_119', 'Sparta', 'IGG Anniversary Envoy', 'Hey, I am the envoy for IGG''s special anniversary celebrations. Brave warrior, can you help me unlock the Treasure Chest? IGG has prepared big anniversary gifts！However, I dropped the key to the Treasure Chest by accident, and the key ended up several hundred pieces. I need you to retract some of  these pieces from Key Collector at Peloponnesus (73, -21)  or Marathon (81,63) . Be wary of the hostile Anniversary Chest Bandits who will assault whoever is holding a full set of pieces near the Anniversary Chest. Anniversary Chests need to be defended carefully, as those bandits are not pushovers.'),
    ('Sparta_120', 'Sparta', 'Profession Mentor', 'There are 4 types of Professions in GodsWar Online,|cffF14187Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Mythcrafting and Scholarship|cffffffff. If you are unhappy with your current profession, you may unlearn it and start a new one, but |cffF14187 this will completely remove all traces of the former profession,including any skills or recipes associated with it|cffffffff. Please make sure this is acceptable before you unlearn a profession.'),
    ('Sparta_121', 'Sparta', 'Alchemy Recipe Vendor', 'Hey, come take a look at my goods! Best in all of Greece!'),
    ('Sparta_122', 'Sparta', 'Ingredients Vendors', 'Look here! Good Ingredients for sale at reasonable price.'),
    ('Sparta_123', 'Sparta', 'Prize Chest', 'A convenient and thrilling chest where you claim the prizes (including B-GOLD) handed out by GM.'),
    ('Sparta_124', 'Sparta', 'Event Awarder', 'You can claim rewards from me after the event has closed.'),
    ('Sparta_125', 'Sparta', 'Trojan War Coordinator', 'Paris, the seductive prince of Troy, lured Helen away to the city of Troy.  Agamemnon, the great Greek leader has decided to launch an attack on Troy to get her back and teach the Trojans a lesson for their impudence.  All warriors in the land should join the fight for the glory of Greece!'),
    ('Sparta_126', 'Sparta', 'Carnival Envoy', 'A certain amount of wish-making credits is to be earned if you buy the selected items from the Item Mall before Sept 29th.      Before October 13th, you can use the earned wish-making credits to wish for the cool and rare items not available in the Item Mall. Your wish might come true with certain odds. Hesitate no further, and head over to win.'),
    ('Sparta_127', 'Sparta', 'Treasury Official', '|cffF14187I am responsible for the security of traders and merchants here. |cffffffff               The Treasure Bandits have been stealing from more and more people over the past several weeks, and we cannot let it continue. They must be brought to justice. This is why we are empowering anyone brave enough to face them with the task of capturing them.'),
    ('Sparta_128', 'Sparta', 'Easter Envoy', 'We’re introducing a fun new event in celebration of Easter! Click the Event Details button to find out more.'),
    ('Sparta_129', 'Sparta', 'Rich Man Envoy', 'I am the Rich Man Envoy. How about trying your luck here? Just hand over some Level 1 crystals to me for your chance to get rich quick!'),
    ('Sparta_130', 'Sparta', 'Sacred Sealer', '|cffF14187I am the Sacred Sealer:|cffffffff                                                                                                                  I have some scrolls that have legendary creatures sealed inside. With these scrolls, you can summon these beasts. Once they have been defeated, you can loot their treasure. Don''t think for a moment these scrolls are free, do you know what I had to do to get them...? Actually it''s better if I don''t tell you. At any rate, you''ve got to cough up some Gold if you want one of these scrolls.'),
    ('Sparta_131', 'Sparta', 'Holy Stone Redeemer', 'Everyone will be able to exchange up to 3 [Holy Stone Package Vouchers] with me for 3 bound [Holy Stone Packages]. One for one. [Holy Stone Package Vouchers] can be purchased from the [Item Mall] for only 1800 Gold. Each [Holy Stone Package Voucher] can be exchanged for one [Holy Stone Package] containing items worth up to 6,100 Gold.  If you have bought too many [Holy Stone Package Vouchers], you must return the unused ones for a refund . o learn how to use Holy Stones, check out our in-game tutorial here.[LINK to tutorial]'),
    ('Sparta_132', 'Sparta', 'Online Award Admin', 'Just stay online for 4 hours each day to receive one free Quest Scroll.'),
    ('Sparta_133', 'Sparta', 'B-Gold Trader', 'B-Gold Trader  Greetings! I''ve made a fortune trading B-Gold, and if you would like to take advantage of my services, I''ll give you 360 B-Gold in exchange for 180 Gold. Keep in mind I don''t carry a lot of B-Gold with me, after all one can''t be too careful these days, so I can only trade with each player once each day.Notes.    1.B-Gold binds when acquired. B-Gold can be used to purchase items from the [B-Gold vendor] and the [B-Gold shop] located in the area of (145,-137) in each of the main cities.2. Players can only exchange for B-Gold once each day.3. Players can only exchange for B-Gold between the hours of 12:00AM and 11:55PM each day.'),
    ('Sparta_134', 'Sparta', 'Warehouse Manager', 'With my help, you''ll be able to open a lot more Storagee Boxes using the same amount of Storage Box Keys.'),
    ('Sparta_135', 'Sparta', 'Forging Recipe Vendor', 'Hey, come take a look at my goods! Best in all of Greece!'),
    ('Sparta_136', 'Sparta', 'Mythcrafting Recipe Vendor', 'Hey, come take a look at my goods! Best in all of Greece!'),
    ('Sparta_137', 'Sparta', 'Scholarship Recipe Vendor', 'Hey, come take a look at my goods! Best in all of Greece!'),
    ('Sparta_138', 'Sparta', 'Plastic Surgeon', 'Do you want to change your gender? Don''t just stand there staring, if you''re not happy the way you are now, then tell me. Are you sure you want to change your gender?'),
    ('Sparta_139', 'Sparta', 'Personal Helper', 'I know how troublesome it is to only be able to use items one at a time - as such, I''ve devised a way to enable batch usage of |cff39D8B8[Morning Dew I], [EXP Stone 3], and [Talent Stone 3]|cffffffff! Well, you can thank me later!'),
    ('Sparta_140', 'Sparta', 'Mystery Merchant', 'Hail, adventurer! I''m from faraway, and I deal in all kinds of exotic and fine wares. Take a look!'),
    ('Sparta_141', 'Sparta', 'Faction Changer', 'Do you want to change your faction? Don’t just stand there in silence; if you’re not satisfied with your current faction, let me know. Are you certain you want to switch factions?'),
    ('Sparta_142', 'Sparta', 'Level Sealer', 'Ah, a bold adventurer! I see you’ve reached the Level 89. Would you like me to seal your level? Once sealed, you’ll remain at 89 but can still gain experience. This is useful for honing your skills and earning rewards without leveling up further. Think carefully—once sealed, you’ll be locked at this level until you choose to unseal. If you’re ready, let me know, and I’ll take care of the rest.'),
    ('Sparta_143', 'Sparta', 'Origin Enhancer', 'I may not be as skilled as Hephaestus, but I know how to make your gear shine. Whether it’s your mount or your wardrobe, I can enhance them to perfection. Just don''t expect my master to approve of my... extra flair."'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_001', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Farmer Layland', 'Do you know how to tame an animal into a pet? Listen to me, it''s so easy, all you need is the right tool.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_002', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Farmer Kozma', 'Damn, my farmland has been almost completely destroyed.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_003', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Fisher Calisto', 'Would you please help me return to the fishing village? It is being occupied by a lot of evil monsters.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_004', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Skill]Theophilus', 'When you hit a new level, you will be able to learn new spells from some items. You can loot these items from monsters or they can be purchased from the Mall. Once you''ve gained a new spell, remember to press the S key to unfold your spell panel and drag the spell into the action bar for quick use.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_005', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Inspector Nolan', 'I am busy inspecting everyone and everything. You wouldn''t believe how corrupt and evil everyone is. But I will continue to work hard to bring peace and justice to this beautiful land.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_006', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Wanted Criminals', 'There are several tough criminals on the wanted list. Do you dare to attempt to capture any of them?'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_007', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Odysseus', 'We don''t fight alone. Have you ever heard of the Argo Volunteer Club?  I am a member…'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_008', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Chiron', 'I am a stranger, it''s not my true face, but I will give my helping hand if I am needed.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_009', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Props]Zinoviou', 'Haha, I have everything that you expect to find. Come to buy it!'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_010', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Warrior]Simonos', 'Hi, warrior! I have all kinds of weapons for you to choose from.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_011', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Scholar]Ianeira', 'A wise scholar needs cool gear. Don''t forget to update!'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_012', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Warehouse]Savva', 'Hi, warehouses can be used to deposit items, do you want to do so? There is an |cfffdd3b9Argo|cffffffff at the foot of Pelion. It is made by many craftsmen under the guidance of Athena.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_013', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Skill]Filippou', 'There are lots of monsters outside the newbie camp, trying to defeat them is the best training.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_014', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Armor]Aglaias', 'Prepare enough materials before fighting against monsters, so you can win. Are you ready? I have a variety of armor, have a look!'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_015', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Jewelry]Glauce', 'I come from Corinth. Do you know the sea is green, so my name is Glauce.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_016', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Props]Cora', 'Welcome! There is a Dodona Oak Wood given by Athena on the Argo wall. It can be used for announcing oracles.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_017', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Olympics Competitor', 'I plan to participate in the Sports Competition in Olympia. But Olympia belongs to Elis Polis now. The king of Elis wants to sign a peace contract with Sparta during the competition. The torch relay is mysterious and superb…I am good at wrestling and throwing discus.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_018', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Newbie Events Transporter', 'If you are level |cffF1418720-75|cffffffff, then I can send you to some special Newbie practicing maps between |cffF14187 8：00pmto9：00pm every day|cffffffff.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_019', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Pet Master', 'I am sent by Hera to distribute pet eggs to people of this world. Once you have an egg, click on it to hatch your baby pet.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_020', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Gear Giver', 'When you reach level |cffF1418710|cffffffff, come to me to claim some gear. You will be rewarded every |cffF141875|cffffffff levels from |cffF14187Level 10|cffffffff to |cffF14187Level 40|cffffffff.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_021', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Gift Envoy', 'Ha-ha, happy holidays! I only appear on special holidays. Don''t miss out the gifts I am giving away!'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_022', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Instructor', 'Warrior, when you reach Level 3, 15 and 31, come talk with me and I will teach a bit more as well as give you rewards for working so hard.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_023', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'War Supplier 2', 'I won''t accept the materials until you give it to me while in a team with |cffF141875 people|cffffffff. Different materials will bring you different rewards.  Certainly, you can also hand in materials to |cffF14187CWar Supplier 1|cffffffff in the main city or |cffF14187War Supplier 3|cffffffff in Peloponnesus.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_024', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Fitness Trainer 1', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to attend the round-the-city race |cffF1418712:00am-11:55pm, every Monday through Saturday|cFFFFFFFF. You are allowed to join the race up to |cffF14187 6 times |cffffffff a day! You will be rewarded 180 B-GOLD each the first two races in a day, and 90 B-GOLD for every race thereafter that day.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_025', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Fitness Trainer 2', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_026', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Fitness Trainer 3', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_027', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Fitness Trainer 4', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_028', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Fitness Trainer 5', 'Hello, I am Hygeia''s envoy. You are welcome to take part in the round-the-city race!'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_029', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Ancient Relics 1', 'Exchange Sheepskin Scroll 1 for |cffF14187Lost Book Chapter 1|cffffffff.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_030', 'Sparta_Newbie', 'Ancient Relics 6', 'Exchange Sheepskin Scroll 6 for |cffF14187Lost Book Chapter 6|cffffffff.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_031', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Event]Zeus'' Loyal Believer', 'The Almighty Zeus rules over the Olympian Gods with wisdom and gives us strength. I am unable to give him anything in return, except my gratitude and loyal service. Would you like to do the same? Zeus will know of your devotion and give you blessings in return. Also, the more gifts you deliver, the greater the rewards - even double on the weekends! Just a hint, the |cffF14187 Cursed Zone |cffffffff and |cffF14187 Treasure Land |cffffffff have many of Zeus'' favorite gifts.'),
    ('Sparta_Newbie_032', 'Sparta_Newbie', '[Event]Praying Saint', 'Dear friend, you must always keep mind that without Zeus'' blessings we cannot live a good life at all. During every |cffF141879 0:00PM Saturday and 11:55PM Sunday|cffffffff, Zeus always commands me to give out innumerous precious treasures, including a great deal of experience and talent points. If you want to get them, you must first offer Zeus |cffF14187Praying Stone|cffffffff.'),
