    ('Thebes_All_001', 'Thebes_All', 'kreon', 'Greetings, I am Kreon, King of Thebes.'),
    ('Thebes_All_002', 'Thebes_All', 'Oedipus', 'Somebody said I was destined to kill my father at some point, but I could never do such a thing.'),
    ('Thebes_All_003', 'Thebes_All', 'Hippolytus', 'My father is Theseus, and my mother is Hippolyte, the Amazonian queen possessing a magical girdle given by her father Ares, the God of war. Everyone knows the Amazon warriors, they are as famous for their beauty, as they are for their strength and courage.'),
    ('Thebes_All_004', 'Thebes_All', 'Tiresias', 'Cronus is near the border with Attica somewhere. The people are always willing to protect righteous fighters.'),
    ('Thebes_All_005', 'Thebes_All', 'Ismene', 'My beloved sister Antigone can be pretty sentimental at times.'),
    ('Thebes_All_006', 'Thebes_All', 'Polynices', 'I''ve finally arrived home. My father is Oedipus, who is known throughout the land for solving the riddle of the Sphinx.'),
    ('Thebes_All_007', 'Thebes_All', 'Eurydice', 'Oedipus is a real man.'),
    ('Thebes_All_008', 'Thebes_All', 'Jocasta', 'What animals walk on 4 legs in the morning, 3 legs in the afternoon and 2 legs in the evening? That''s too difficult for me to answer.'),
    ('Thebes_All_009', 'Thebes_All', 'Rhadamanthus', 'Minos, the hateful Lord of Crete, is my brother, but he exiled me to Boeotia. I have come to accept my exile and plan to found a new nation on this pure, fertile land.'),
    ('Thebes_All_010', 'Thebes_All', 'Physician', 'Want a massage? I rub you long time.'),
    ('Thebes_All_011', 'Thebes_All', '[Props]Andrea', 'Thebes has seven city gates. Do you know how to breach them?'),
    ('Thebes_All_012', 'Thebes_All', '[Warehouse]Phaedra', 'Ariadne is my younger sister. We are both very fond of Theseus.'),
    ('Thebes_All_013', 'Thebes_All', 'Podaleirios', 'Machaon is my brother. Hopefully I can become a great surgeon like him.'),
    ('Thebes_All_014', 'Thebes_All', 'Telesphoros', 'I should wear a hood and a cloak to look like a travelling surgeon.'),
    ('Thebes_All_015', 'Thebes_All', 'Haemon', 'I am Haemon, son of Kreon.'),
    ('Thebes_All_016', 'Thebes_All', 'Epione', 'Hotsprings are effective in pacifying souls and healing scars. So I believe building a statue beside the hotspring will be a very significant thing.'),
    ('Thebes_All_017', 'Thebes_All', 'Aceso', 'All talented surgeons hold staves in their hands, looking very cool.'),
    ('Thebes_All_018', 'Thebes_All', 'Physical Curer', 'Do you need a massage?'),
    ('Thebes_All_019', 'Thebes_All', 'Viotia Ranger', 'Mountains almost cover the whole eastern part of Greece, where there exists various strange creatures. By the way, have you ever seen a camel? There are no camels here, but poisonous snakes and huge dragons.'),
    ('Thebes_All_020', 'Thebes_All', '[Props]Andrea', 'Have you ever heard of Andromeda, the Ethiopian princess? People created a statue for her along the coast.'),
    ('Thebes_All_021', 'Thebes_All', 'Resting Male Priest', 'The churchwomen of Dionysus always like to host carnivals on Cithaero.'),
    ('Thebes_All_022', 'Thebes_All', '[Warrior]Servant', 'I heard the Argo Volunteer Club had taken Polynices and Tydeus in.'),
    ('Thebes_All_023', 'Thebes_All', '[Scholar]Believer', 'Polynices is Oedipus'' son. Polynices has gone to Corinth but Oedipus is lost.'),
    ('Thebes_All_024', 'Thebes_All', '[Skill]Agent', 'Thebes has seven city gates. Do you know how to breach them?'),
    ('Thebes_All_025', 'Thebes_All', '[Jewelry]Phaedra', 'Ariadne is my younger sister. We are both fond of Theseus.'),
    ('Thebes_All_026', 'Thebes_All', '[Warehouse]Origin Express', 'Greetings, we are express deliverers. It is our pleasure to help you deliver anything you like as fast as we can run!'),
    ('Thebes_All_027', 'Thebes_All', 'Mycenae Transporter', 'Brave one - will you really teleport to Mycenae? It''s dangerous! Mycenae opens from 12:00 - 23:55                                Level Requirement: 130+ (includes 130)                           Fees: 20,000 Silver                                                 |cffF14187A party is recommended.|cffffffff'),
    ('Thebes_All_028', 'Thebes_All', 'Gem Merchant', 'Hail, brave adventurer! Give me enough gems, and I''ll be happy to hand you some Super Skillbooks!'),
    ('Thermopylae_001', 'Thermopylae', 'Zeus'' Envoy 1', 'If you want to go to Athens,please click me.'),
    ('Thermopylae_002', 'Thermopylae', 'Zeus'' Envoy 2', 'If you want to go to Sparta,please click me.'),
    ('Thermopylae_003', 'Thermopylae', 'Instance', 'OK,now!'),
    ('Thermopylae_004', 'Thermopylae', 'Spartan Awarder', 'You can claim rewards from me after you come back from the instance.'),
    ('Thermopylae_005', 'Thermopylae', 'Athenian Awarder', 'You can claim rewards from me after you come back from the instance.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_001', 'Thermopylae_All', '[Round Quest]Athenian Issuer', 'I give out the round quest.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_002', 'Thermopylae_All', '[Daily Quest]Athenian Issuer', 'Daily quests are a great way to pick up big rewards. Don''t forget to do them every day.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_003', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Aristotle', 'We will definitely drive the Persian invaders away from Thermopylae. Victory will belong to us!'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_004', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Pausanians', 'We will definitely drive the Persian invaders away from Thermopylae because we have so many brave fighters!'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_005', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Kimon', 'I love Athens. I love Sparta too. You are right, I am neutral.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_006', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Dieneces', 'There are so many Persian archers that when they fire a full volley, even the bright sun is hidden from view. No matter, if that''s their plan, we will fight in the shade!'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_007', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Simonides', 'Wow, what a nice life! Everything is so beautiful!'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_008', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Leonidas', 'Brave soldiers, let''s fight against the Persian invaders and fight for Greece!'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_009', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Telephus', 'My wife is a Persian, so I don''t want to see war between the Greeks and Persians. However, the outcome is not up to me.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_010', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Eurypylus', 'My father Telephus is the leader of Mysia. Actually, we are Greek but I have the blood of a Persian running through me… How complex the world is! Why do we fight against each other?'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_011', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Athenian Postman', 'Postmen can be found anywhere.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_012', 'Thermopylae_All', '[Warehouse]Kyana', 'Do you wish to store something in the warehouse?'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_013', 'Thermopylae_All', '[Warehouse]Fidero', 'Do you wish to store something in the warehouse?'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_014', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Athenian Physician', 'Glad to see you! I am the best physician in Greece. May I help you?'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_015', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Spartan Physician', 'Glad to see you! I am the best physician in Greece. May I help you?'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_016', 'Thermopylae_All', '[Props]Ayrefar', 'You should take enough potion to sustain your strength. I have many kinds to choose from.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_017', 'Thermopylae_All', '[Props]Kenny', 'You should take enough potion to sustain your strength. I have many kinds to choose from.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_018', 'Thermopylae_All', '[Round Quest]Spartan Issuer', 'I give out the round quest.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_019', 'Thermopylae_All', '[Daily Quest]Spartan Issuer', 'Daily quests are a great way to pick up big rewards. Don''t forget to do them every day.'),
    ('Thermopylae_All_020', 'Thermopylae_All', 'Spartan Postman', 'Postmen can be found anywhere.'),
    ('Troy_001', 'Troy', 'Trojan War Transporter', 'The Olympian gods will bless us. As long as we break through the beach defenses, we will be able to be defeat Troy.'),
    ('Troy_002', 'Troy', 'Beach Transporter', 'The Olympian gods will bless us. I can help transport you back to the beach.'),
    ('Troy_003', 'Troy', 'Agamemnon', 'Those Trojan scoundrels stole Helen, wife to my brother Menelaus. I will make them pay a steep price for their insolence!'),
    ('Troy_004', 'Troy', 'Menelaus', 'Paris will die by my hands!'),
    ('Troy_005', 'Troy', 'Helen', 'I never wanted to bring disaster to the city.'),
    ('Troy_006', 'Troy', 'Archer Pandarus'' Treasure Chest', 'You have to bring down Pandarus to get his treasure chest. Before rushing into combat, think of the risk!cffF14187Notes: Claim the rewards for defeating a BOSS before beginning combat against another one, or else you will forfeit the rewards.|cffffffff'),
    ('Troy_007', 'Troy', 'Warrior Sarpedon''s Treasure Chest', 'You have to bring down Sarpedon to get his treasure chest. |cffF14187Notes: Claim the rewards for defeating a BOSS before beginning combat against another one, or else you will forfeit the rewards.|cffffffff'),
    ('Troy_008', 'Troy', 'Prince Lycaon''s Treasure Chest', 'You have to bring down Lycaon to get his treasure chest. |cffF14187Notes: Claim the rewards for defeating a BOSS before beginning combat against another one, or else you will forfeit the rewards.|cffffffff'),
    ('Troy_009', 'Troy', 'Prince Paris'' Treasure Chest', 'You have to bring down Paris to get his treasure chest. |cffF14187Notes: Claim the rewards for defeating a BOSS before beginning combat against another one, or else you will forfeit the rewards.|cffffffff'),
    ('Troy_010', 'Troy', 'Prince Hector''s Treasure Chest', 'You have to bring down Hector to get his treasure chest. |cffF14187Notes: Claim the rewards for defeating a BOSS before beginning combat against another one, or else you will forfeit the rewards.|cffffffff'),
    ('Troy_011', 'Troy', 'Troy Transporter', 'As long as you break through the beach defenses, I will be able to get you into Troy.'),
    ('Troy_012', 'Troy', 'Deific Chest', 'To get this, you have to defeat certain weakened deities.|cffF14187Notes: Claim the rewards for defeating a BOSS before beginning combat against another one, or else you will forfeit the rewards.|cffffffff'),
    ('WarField_001', 'WarField', '[Sparta]Returning Helper', 'The Spartan advance troops keep in close touch with the main city, so I can send you back to the main city immediately.'),
    ('WarField_002', 'WarField', '[Sparta]Quartermaster', 'I provide |cff39D8B8Holy Water|cffffffff blessed by the Priest. Each player is limited to 1 bottle at one time.'),
    ('WarField_003', 'WarField', 'Battlefield Crier', 'Soldiers, get ready for a fight. Claim some Holy Water from the [Sparta]War Supplier, and then deliver them to an altar to earn experience and points. If you deliver some to an allied altar, you will earn 30 points. If you deliver some to a hostile altar, you''ll earn 100 points!'),
    ('WarField_004', 'WarField', '[Sparta]Point Searcher', 'Welcome! Thank you for your support! We are utterly convinced that we will drive those Athenians out of the Pindus Mountains soon. Well, you want to know who the bravest warrior with the most points is?'),
    ('WarField_005', 'WarField', '[Sparta]Fortune Altar', 'Obtain |cff39D8B8Holy Water|cffffffff from the War Supplier, and submit it here to amass points for later use. Each Spartan can exchange 1 Holy Water for 30 points, while each Athenian will earn 100 points.'),
    ('WarField_006', 'WarField', '[Athens]Returning Helper', 'The Athenian advance troops keep in close touch with the main city, so I can send you back to the main city immediately.'),
    ('WarField_007', 'WarField', '[Athens]Quartermaster', 'I provide |cff39D8B8Holy Water|cffffffff blessed by the Priest. Each player is limited to 1 bottle at one time.'),
    ('WarField_008', 'WarField', 'Battlefield Crier', 'Soldiers, get ready for a fight. Claim some Holy Water from the [Athens]War Supplier, and then deliver them to an altar to earn experience and points. If you deliver some to an allied altar, you will earn 30 points. If you deliver some to a hostile altar, you''ll earn 100 points!'),
    ('WarField_009', 'WarField', '[Athens]Point Searcher', 'Welcome! Thank you for your support! We are utterly convinced that we will drive those Spartans out of the Pindus Mountains soon. Well, you want to know who the bravest warrior with the most points is?'),
    ('WarField_010', 'WarField', '[Athens]Fortune Altar', 'Obtain |cff39D8B8Holy Water|cffffffff from the War Supplier, and submit it here to amass points for later use. Each Athenian can exchange 1 Holy Water for 30 points, while each Spartan will earn 100 points.'),
    ('WarField_011', 'WarField', '[Athens]Fortune Altar', 'Obtain |cff39D8B8Holy Water|cffffffff from the War Supplier, and submit it here to amass points for later use. Each Athenian can exchange 1 Holy Water for 30 points, while each Spartan will earn 100 points.'),
    ('WarField_012', 'WarField', '[Athens]Fortune Altar', 'Obtain |cff39D8B8Holy Water|cffffffff from the War Supplier, and submit it here to amass points for later use. Each Athenian can exchange 1 Holy Water for 30 points, while each Spartan will earn 100 points.'),
    ('WarField_013', 'WarField', '[Athens]Fortune Altar', 'Obtain |cff39D8B8Holy Water|cffffffff from the War Supplier, and submit it here to amass points for later use. Each Athenian can exchange 1 Holy Water for 30 points, while each Spartan will earn 100 points.'),
